    "European calibration of allergies.",
    "EAACI 2022: 25-35% EU population affected by at least one allergic disease.",
    "Models: allergic rhinitis, food allergies, drug allergies, insect venom.",
    "EU-specific: penicillin over-labelling, NSAID hypersensitivity, HDM dominance.",
